            <ArticleTitle>Developing a tool to diagnose cases of necrotising fasciitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>307-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The rising incidence and high mortality of this soft-tissue disease means it is vital to make a speedy diagnosis. The study described in this paper set out to develop a protocol to aid clinicians to make a rapid diagnosis and initiate prompt treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
